namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamLayerStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamLayerStyle.h#DreamLayerStyle
    src   "An image editor's layer style on a widget: drop shadows, an outer glow, inner shadows, an inner glow, a bevel and emboss, a\nsatin, colour, gradient and pattern overlays, strokes (FDreamLayerEffects). Each effect blends by its own mode, at its own\nopacity; the drop shadows and the outer glow lie behind the widget, the rest on it.\n\nWhat it is drawn round: the widget's own element when it has one -- a rect block in its own pixels, anything else drawn apart\nand measured -- and the widget's subtree when it has no element of its own (a container) or is a layer group drawn apart. On a\nshape blend group's widget (UDreamShapeBlendGroup) it is round the melted shape, in the pixels of the member that draws it.\nA preset names a shared style (UDreamLayerStylePreset); while there is one, its style is drawn and this one's is not.\n\nA rect block's own shadows, border and gradient (UDreamRectBlock) are a second way to write four of these effects: see\nUDreamRectBlock::GetEffectsAsLayerStyle. The style does not take part in hit tests."
    text  "控件上的图像编辑器图层样式：投影、外发光、内阴影、内发光、斜面和浮雕、\n光泽、颜色、渐变和图案叠加、描边（FDreamLayerEffects）。每个效果按各自的模式、各自的\n不透明度混合；投影和外发光位于控件之后，其余效果位于控件之上。\n\n绘制范围：控件有自身元素时为该元素——矩形块按其自身像素，其他元素单独绘制\n并测量——控件没有自身元素（容器）或为单独绘制的图层组时为其子树。在\n形状混合组的控件（UDreamShapeBlendGroup）上，它环绕融合后的形状，以绘制它的成员的像素为单位。\n预设指定一个共享样式（UDreamLayerStylePreset）；存在预设时，绘制预设的样式，而不绘制此样式。\n\n矩形块自身的阴影、边框和渐变（UDreamRectBlock）是编写其中四种效果的另一种方式：参见\nUDreamRectBlock::GetEffectsAsLayerStyle。该样式不参与命中测试。"
    state machine
}

