EDreamLayerStylePath.Element {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamLayerStyle.h#EDreamLayerStylePath:Element
    src   "In the element's own pixels, in the batch it is drawn with: a rect block's shape is measured where it is drawn."
    text  "以元素自身的像素为单位，在绘制它所用的批次中：矩形块的形状在其绘制位置测量。"
    state machine
}

EDreamLayerStylePath.Group {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamLayerStyle.h#EDreamLayerStylePath:Group
    src   "The widget is drawn into a texture of its own, which is measured (a jump flood of its alpha) and styled as it is put down:\nany other element, a text, an image, a container's subtree, a layer group. Its outer effects blend with what is behind\nby their own modes. Only where the canvas draws groups apart (UDreamLayerGroup); elsewhere the style is not drawn."
    text  "控件被绘制到其自身的纹理中，该纹理会进行测量（对其 Alpha 做跳跃洪泛）并在放置时应用样式：\n任何其他元素、文本、图像、容器的子树、图层组。其外部效果按各自的模式与其后方的内容混合。\n仅在画布单独绘制组的地方可用（UDreamLayerGroup）；其他位置不绘制该样式。"
    state machine
}

